    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it just feels like a lot of work to keep \"finding value\" in small things when the scale of it all is so crushing. everything feels so heavy and exhausting. if everything is truly indifferent and everything we do is just a temporary flicker, why do we have to keep struggling through this? it feels like we're just fighting a losing battle against nothingness.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
